:''For the enemy encountered in [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]], see [[Lancer (Enemy)]].''
'''Lancer''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 366
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Lancer
|name2 = Lancer CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Lancer CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Treat Lancer as a better [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut]]: a unit who can be used anywhere for general damage, but for little more. His stats are not that good compared to other pure generalists, but his lack of real downsides prevents him from being fully outclassed.

Of course, he is also viable as a barrier breaker, as his health and range tend to allow him to stay alive for quite a while, during which he may strike down plenty of barriers.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

